# Modules that ship as files but must not register as commands, so the panel matches the
# 27 skills upstream's own .claude-plugin/plugin.json declares. references/misc/ holds
# third-party utilities upstream keeps on disk and out of its manifest; in-progress/ is
# not promoted yet and deprecated/ has no modules left. Files stay in the package either
# way — read them by path.
references/misc/
references/in-progress/
references/deprecated/
